    "specifications": "AI_DATA <p> RCC </p><ul><li>The project uses M25/M30 grade ready mix concrete &amp; Fe 550D Grade Steel.</li><li>RCC columns and beam grid structure come with RCC slab in plywood finish shuttering.</li></ul><p> Masonry </p><ul><li>External walls use 25/30 cm AAC blocks.</li><li>Internal walls use 10 cm AAC blocks.</li></ul><p> External &amp; Internal Walls : Internal walls carry gypsum &amp; putti plaster.</p><p> Water Proofing : Extensive waterproofing covers all terrace areas, roof slab, sunk slabs, bathrooms and balconies.</p><p> Doors </p><ul><li>Teak wood frames come with digital door lock.</li><li>Shutters use marine quality flush door with polished veneer or laminated finish.</li></ul><p> Living Room : Internet point, ample power sockets and charging points run throughout.</p><p> Kitchen : Platform uses polished granite.</p><p> Electricals </p><ul><li>Fire resistant cables use wiring from:<ul><li>Finolex</li><li>Equivalent make</li></ul></li><li>Electrical switches come from:<ul><li>Legrand</li><li>Equivalent make</li></ul></li></ul><p> Toilets </p><ul><li>Marble/granite counter top wash basin.</li><li>W.C., sanitary fittings &amp; taps come from:<ul><li>Jaquar</li><li>Equivalent make</li></ul></li></ul><p> Flooring </p><ul><li>Vitrified tiles come from:<ul><li>RAK</li><li>Equivalent make</li></ul></li></ul><p> Windows </p><ul><li>Windows come in:<ul><li>Powder coated aluminum</li><li>UPVC</li></ul></li></ul><p> Paint </p><ul><li>External paint uses texture with:<ul><li>Apex Ultima</li><li>Equivalent make</li></ul></li><li>Internal paint uses:<ul><li>Royale Emulsion</li><li>Equivalent make</li></ul></li></ul><p> Power Back Up : 24/7 complete power back up with DG set supports all common areas and elevators.</p><p> Security : CCTV surveillance covers all outdoor common areas.</p><p> Elevators </p><ul><li>Elevators with power back up across the entire complex come from:<ul><li>Kone</li><li>Equivalent make</li></ul></li></ul>",
