    "fullDesc": "Mohidins Mirage is a Under Construction project by Mohidin Properties And Holdings in Sancoale Goa, offering 1,2 BHK Flats configuration. Below are the key details of Mohidins Mirage. <div itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Table\"> <table><tbody><tr><td>Mohidins Mirage Price</td><td>Rs. 6.8 Lac - 1.04 Cr</td></tr><tr><td>Property Types</td><td>1,2 BHK Flats</td></tr><tr><td>Mohidins Mirage Status</td><td>Under Construction</td></tr><tr><td>Mohidins Mirage Launch Date</td><td>01 April 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Mohidins Mirage Possession Date</td><td>01 December 2028</td></tr><tr><td>Towers in Mohidins Mirage</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table> </div>Mohidins Mirage is a renowned project in Sancoale, Goa, which offers homes within the price range of Rs. 6.8 Lac - 1.04 Cr. The premium project is developed by Mohidin Properties And Holdings, a leading and trusted name in the real estate sector. The current construction status of the project is Under Construction. The project spans across 7500 Sq-m. There are in total 97 units in this project.<br><br>The project offers residential 1 towers. The project’s official launch date was recorded as April 2025.The possession of Mohidins Mirage starts from December 2028.  The site's exact address is Plot no. E, Survey no. 89/1, Upasnagar, Sancoale, Goa. The pin code of this project is 403726.  <div itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Table\"><h3 itemprop=\"name\">Mohidins Mirage Floor Plan </h3>  <table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Unit Configuration</th><th scope=\"col\">Unit Size</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mohidins Mirage 1 BHK Flat</td><td>883 Sq. Ft. </td></tr><tr><td>Mohidins Mirage 1 BHK Flat</td><td>83 Sq. Ft. </td></tr><tr><td>Mohidins Mirage 2 BHK Flat</td><td>112 Sq. Ft. </td></tr><tr><td>Mohidins Mirage 2 BHK Flat</td><td>1281 Sq. Ft. </td></tr></tbody></table> </div>The floor plan is a useful document that gives a realistic idea of the space covered, room sizes and the layout of the house. The units in Mohidins Mirage come in a choice of 12 types of floor plans as per the 6 configurations. Well-appointed bathrooms and balconies with a view are part of these units. Magicbricks enumerates different configurations of Mohidins Mirage across a range of unit sizes.<br><br><h3>Mohidins Mirage Brochure </h3> Download the PDF brochure of Mohidins Mirage and get the complete details of this beautifully constructed project. The brochure can be viewed at the top right side of the page under the link 'Download Brochure'. You will need to fill in your contact details as name, number and email ID to be able to view the PDF brochure of Mohidins Mirage.<br><br>"
