    "shortDesc": null,
    "fullDesc": "Mohidin Properties And Holdings - A division of the renowned Mohidin Group has always believed that the living space is an extension of ones own inner life. To materialise the dreams of our clients, we give attention to every details of the interior and exterior space. We have a dedicated team of architects and interior designers to merge the need of our clients with the plan, furniture, floor, kitchen space, etc. By applying our minds and energy we turn ordinary living spaces into modern, contempropry and innovative spaces. No wonder that Mohidin Properties And Holdings emphasis on changing living into an experience. The experience in Real Estate industry have helped us formulate and comprehend the concept of a home. A home is not just a house, but an expression of ones individuality, a home has a soul, a character and a personality all of its own. Needless to say, we give utmost importance in implementing this concept and focus meticulosly on every detail and the clients needs. Quality, Economy and Comfort are the factors that we rely on to achieve the needs of our clients.",
